1
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:43,039
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:43,710
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,970
[Episode 5]

4
00:01:46,350 --> 00:01:48,680
You're also a girl working here?

5
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:49,670
[Divine Constable Tally]

6
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,560
You does look beautiful.

7
00:01:53,789 --> 00:01:55,950
This is interesting.

8
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,400
Your Star-Gathering Pavilion

9
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,950
is quite creative.

10
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,480
How dare you!

11
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:20,600
I never draw my sword

12
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,680
against those who don't
draw their weapons.

13
00:02:21,210 --> 00:02:23,350
[Yan Zige,
No.1 Martial Arts Master of Northern Kun]

14
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:29,360
But if you offend Mr. Wen,

15
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:30,530
then I will

16
00:02:31,079 --> 00:02:32,540
have to make an exception.

17
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:34,630
You Northern Kun people

18
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,260
really have a lot of rules.

19
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:45,410
You're so sharp-eyed.

20
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,800
This Star-Gathering Pavilion

21
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,630
is really something.

22
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:50,720
What a coincidence.

23
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,590
We Great Shi people
also have our own rules.

24
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,420
Even if you are from Northern Kun,

25
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,870
within the borders of the Shi Empire,

26
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:03,680
you must obey the laws of Great Shi.

27
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,960
Under the laws of Great Shi,

28
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,630
those who violate the law
and refuse to obey

29
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,710
shall be executed.

30
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:09,360
Lord Constable Ghost,

31
00:03:09,590 --> 00:03:11,920
the Crown Prince is of noble birth.

32
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:12,890
If by any chance

33
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,680
he gets hurt by vulgar people like us,
it'll inevitably harm

34
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,960
the diplomatic relations
between our two states.

35
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,960
It's not worth it.

36
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:21,010
The Crown Prince of Northern Kun?

37
00:03:25,940 --> 00:03:27,329
Who on earth are you?

38
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:29,560
How could you recognize my identity?

39
00:03:30,970 --> 00:03:33,890
Your Highness, you're wise and mighty,

40
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,400
with a majestic bearing,

41
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,240
like a god descending from heaven.

42
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,030
Seems like

43
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:40,560
our Crown Prince wasn't exaggerating

44
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,960
when he talked about you.

45
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:44,010
Your Crown Prince?

46
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,590
Are you talking about

47
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,400
the incumbent Crown Prince of Great Shi,

48
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,190
Zhou Tiao?

49
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,910
Yes.

50
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,310
Your Highness,

51
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,000
I am Li Si.

52
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,590
This Star-Gathering Pavilion

53
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:01,030
is run by me.

54
00:04:01,430 --> 00:04:02,430
I am fortunate

55
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:05,360
to have won our Crown Prince's favor

56
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,820
and often serve His Highness by his side.

57
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,620
Li Si, Young Master Qingyang,

58
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,900
the one highly favored
by the Crown Prince of Great Shi.

59
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,420
Your Highness, if you don't mind,

60
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,560
I will clear out

61
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,329
all the other guests right away

62
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,800
and reserve all rooms

63
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,950
exclusively
for the Northern Kun delegation.

64
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,950
Everyone at the Star-Gathering Pavilion

65
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:28,950
will serve you only, Your Highness.

66
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,400
How does that sound?

67
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:43,310
Alright,

68
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,190
I will show some respect for Zhou Tiao
and the Divine Constable Bureau

69
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:47,120
today.

70
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:48,240
Let's go!

71
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,240
That was really a close call.

72
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:04,870
Yet

73
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,750
what a pity.

74
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:11,320
If the Crown Prince of Northern Kun

75
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,920
could stay at my Star-Gathering Pavilion

76
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,000
for one night

77
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:17,240
or casually write some calligraphy for us,

78
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,540
wouldn't I make a fortune from it?

79
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:27,970
My Lord, My Lady,

80
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,490
I remained neither servile
nor arrogant just now.

81
00:05:30,490 --> 00:05:32,950
I didn't bring shame
upon our Great Shi, did I?

82
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:34,390
The message from our bureau

83
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,360
only mentioned

84
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,040
the visit of the Northern Kun delegation.

85
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,920
Master Li, how did you know

86
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,240
that the visitor was their Crown Prince?

87
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,040
It seems that

88
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,000
I really need to interrogate you properly
back in the bureau.

89
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,480
To think there's someone in this world

90
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:46,159
with better sources of information
than the Divine Constable Bureau.

91
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:47,190
I'm flattered.

92
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,800
As the saying goes,

93
00:05:50,070 --> 00:05:51,830
money makes the world go round.

94
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:52,950
I just have

95
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,510
a few more people

96
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,390
working for me.

97
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:59,550
Let's head back to Tianhuang City.

98
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:00,920
Leaving so soon?

99
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,680
Master!

100
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,270
Wait...

101
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:03,950
-We'll give a 50% discount here today.
-Where are you going, Master?

102
00:06:03,950 --> 00:06:05,830
Master, when will you come back?

103
00:06:05,830 --> 00:06:06,600
Master!

104
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,610
What's your take on Wenbu's visit

105
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:11,860
to our capital?

106
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,430
Northern Kun and Great Shi
remain in a tense

107
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,430
and dangerous standoff at the border.

108
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:18,240
Visiting at this moment,
Crown Prince Wenbu

109
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,370
probably harbours ulterior motives.

110
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,750
If his visit were for state affairs,

111
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:26,430
he could have just stayed
at the official posthouse.

112
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:28,680
Why would he intend to stay
at Star-Gathering Pavilion?

113
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,510
Moreover,

114
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:32,150
when he saw me expose his identity,

115
00:06:32,470 --> 00:06:33,750
he left immediately.

116
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:35,560
As a dignified Crown Prince,

117
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,700
what exactly was he afraid of?

118
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,270
Keep an eye on him.
I'll go after that one.

119
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:47,950
Okay.

120
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,090
A trick to get me away from there...

121
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:41,190
Master.

122
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,560
Master!

123
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,510
Master...

124
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,220
Master...

125
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,970
Channel your qi.

126
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,940
Channel your qi!

127
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:36,240
How many times have I told you

128
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:39,080
to never use the Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation?

129
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:41,270
Don't you know how great the damage

130
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,789
it'll cause to your body?

131
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:46,190
Also, you have a heart condition now!

132
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:48,120
Are you courting death?

133
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,890
Channel your qi!

134
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:53,060
Channel your qi!

135
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,390
Swallow it!

136
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,000
If you want to die,

137
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,440
just tell me,

138
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,420
and I won't save you again.

139
00:09:27,870 --> 00:09:28,600
How did I get

140
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,750
a disciple like you?

141
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,360
Be gentle.

142
00:09:45,770 --> 00:09:48,330
I'm healed up. I've got my strength back.

143
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:53,260
My old bones can't take it.

144
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,460
You consumed a great deal of inner power

145
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,930
to heal my injury just now.

146
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,000
Let me attend to you more.

147
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:01,910
When you were 8,

148
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,000
it only took

149
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,000
15 minutes to suppress

150
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,030
your illness.

151
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,960
When you were 16,

152
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:14,630
it became one hour and a half.

153
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,320
Now look at you.

154
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:20,320
It takes a couple of hours every time,

155
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,570
and I might not even be able
to hold it back.

156
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,630
I don't really mind.

157
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,490
I'm more worried about you

158
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,790
getting old

159
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,910
and weak,

160
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,360
with impure inner power.

161
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,480
What if you

162
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,600
end up dying from exhaustion

163
00:10:38,790 --> 00:10:40,550
before the illness kills me?

164
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,770
It's rare

165
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:46,790
that you brat actually care about me.

166
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,630
Why does it sound off

167
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,790
to me?

168
00:10:52,810 --> 00:10:53,920
What?

169
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:56,600
You think
I'm not as strong as I used to be,

170
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,240
huh?

171
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,690
Brat, you're getting too bold,

172
00:10:58,690 --> 00:10:59,360
aren't you?

173
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,720
Listen!

174
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:03,130
Your master is still your strong master!

175
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:06,130
Rub it yourself.

176
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:10,670
What? I can't call you out?

177
00:11:13,910 --> 00:11:14,720
Back then,

178
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,300
I got this heart-burning disease

179
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,670
shortly after you

180
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:20,240
ran into me and took me in.

181
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:22,150
Strangely enough,

182
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,300
I contracted it

183
00:11:24,550 --> 00:11:26,030
rather peculiarly.

184
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:29,090
The world sees
plenty more peculiar things.

185
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,440
Master,

186
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,200
when you found me back then,

187
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:35,030
did you really not see

188
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:36,550
any puppet dolls?

189
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,550
How many times have I told you?

190
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,600
No!

191
00:11:42,270 --> 00:11:43,320
And I've never heard of

192
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,550
any puppet doll,

193
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:46,150
except from you.

194
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,960
Hasn't that Spice-Refining Case
been solved?

195
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,620
Didn't you find out anything?

196
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,370
I didn't get any answers from them.

197
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,510
However,

198
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,440
I did find a clue

199
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:58,430
related to the Kingdom of Liluo.

200
00:11:58,670 --> 00:11:59,600
Liluo?

201
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,440
I've heard of it.

202
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:05,790
Didn't it fall long ago?

203
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:08,360
Just because it fell,

204
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,010
it's hard to investigate.

205
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,000
Now,

206
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:12,910
be it the Kingdom of Liluo

207
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:13,840
from 47 years ago

208
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,270
or the Mulan Hunting Ground

209
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:16,150
from 17 years ago,

210
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:18,150
there's no way to investigate them.

211
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,390
It seems that

212
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:23,270
there's only one way to go.

213
00:12:23,270 --> 00:12:25,030
There's no way at all.

214
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:26,550
Listen,

215
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,910
Li Si,

216
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:33,510
do not ever mess with Tianshu Pavilion.

217
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,560
Those two persistent guys are coming
after us.

218
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,910
I'm warning you one last time,

219
00:12:41,910 --> 00:12:42,670
Li Si.

220
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:44,840
If you still don't listen to me,

221
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,970
I won't look after you anymore!

222
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,000
I'm leaving.

223
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,390
I was exhausted

224
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,630
from traveling for days.

225
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:03,440
So I

226
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,550
washed my face just now.

227
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:07,010
Where's your accomplice?

228
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:09,330
Mr. Meng, what are you saying?

229
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,150
I only washed my face.

230
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:13,190
Do I need an accomplice for that?

231
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,800
My Lord, My Lady,

232
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,420
would you like to wash your faces too?

233
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:23,690
[Tianhuang City,
the capital of the Shi Empire]

234
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:26,500
Don't push!

235
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:28,000
One at a time, okay?

236
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,670
One at a time!

237
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,440
Don't push!

238
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,270
One at a time!

239
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:31,630
One at a time!

240
00:13:32,110 --> 00:13:32,910
One...

241
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,800
Aren't we traveling incognito?

242
00:13:35,910 --> 00:13:39,720
[Zhou Tiao,
the Crown Prince of the Shi Empire]

243
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:38,630
Why do I feel like these lowly commoners

244
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:40,960
have all recognized me, the Crown Prince?

245
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:44,820
[Zhao Shanlei, the eunuch in charge]

246
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:43,010
Your Highness!

247
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,550
As handsome,

248
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:47,000
spirited,

249
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,000
and full of regal bearing as you are,

250
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,360
you can't hide it even if you try.

251
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,050
Everyone! Everyone!

252
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,740
I, the Crown Prince...

253
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,800
Young Master.

254
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,320
I, the Young Master,

255
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,840
am just out today

256
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:13,600
to observe the lives of the people.

257
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:15,600
Given the way you are, it's not easy

258
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:18,260
-to make people not recognize you.
-I am so happy

259
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,550
to see

260
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:22,510
your businesses all thriving.

261
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,240
Don't rush.

262
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:28,000
One at a time.

263
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,320
One at a time.

264
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:30,870
One at a time!

265
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:31,840
One at a time!

266
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,000
-Young Master, mine...
-One at a time.

267
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,200
What is this?

268
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,480
This is a large meat pancake

269
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,940
from my century-old shop.

270
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,000
Buy some.

271
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:39,790
Okay.

272
00:14:39,910 --> 00:14:40,720
Hold on.

273
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,240
Delicious.

274
00:14:44,670 --> 00:14:45,790
Buy all of these.

275
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:46,080
He wants them.

276
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,670
As well as the shop.

277
00:14:46,670 --> 00:14:47,630
Buy his shop.

278
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:48,200
Buy his shop?

279
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,030
Hire him, too,

280
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:50,320
and have him cook in my mansion.

281
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,080
Thank you, Young Master!

282
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:51,390
Wait...

283
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,240
I'll go arrange it right away!

284
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,440
Young Master, have a taste!

285
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,970
Young Master, give it a try!

286
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,630
The Young Master bought my entire shop

287
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:58,080
and also hired me!

288
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,550
Has the Crown Prince

289
00:14:59,550 --> 00:15:01,510
never even eaten a sesame pancake?

290
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:03,840
The sesame pancakes the Crown Prince eats

291
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,870
are always taken back,

292
00:15:04,870 --> 00:15:07,400
cut into pieces,
and decorated with flowers.

293
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,910
How would he know
what a whole sesame pancake

294
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,030
looks like?

295
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,890
We don't have enough money.

296
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:16,070
How can we not have enough money?

297
00:15:16,070 --> 00:15:16,930
Your Highness,

298
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:19,390
every time you travel incognito

299
00:15:19,410 --> 00:15:20,750
and take a liking to something,

300
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:22,910
you just pay and take both the people

301
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:25,240
and their shops away with you.

302
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,390
If you keep this up,

303
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:27,480
even mountains of gold and silver

304
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,840
will be emptied.

305
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:29,960
You good-for-nothing.

306
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,720
Why does Qingyang

307
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,980
never run out of money?

308
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,420
Where is Qingyang?

309
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:35,810
How come I've heard

310
00:15:36,630 --> 00:15:37,720
that he is wanted?

311
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:38,800
That's right.

312
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:39,960
The Divine Constable Bureau

313
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,050
issued a notice a few days ago.

314
00:15:41,050 --> 00:15:42,340
Young Master Qingyang

315
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:45,150
is a suspect in the case
of refining the Spice with young girls.

316
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,480
I guess he just ran away.

317
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,120
I've also heard that

318
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:50,240
the real culprit
has already been executed

319
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,030
by the Divine Constable Bureau
in Dougu County.

320
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:53,750
It's said that you, Young Master Qingyang,

321
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:56,150
are well acquainted with the Crown Prince.

322
00:15:56,990 --> 00:15:58,700
If the Crown Prince sees Li Si,

323
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:00,390
I'm afraid it will cause
unnecessary trouble.

324
00:16:00,390 --> 00:16:02,360
That's right. Let's leave now.

325
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:05,810
I guess he will be back

326
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,750
in just a few days.

327
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:08,480
I can't wait a few days.

328
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,550
I want my cash cow

329
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:10,440
right now!

330
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,550
If you can't even bring me money,

331
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:12,790
aren't you a good-for-nothing?

332
00:16:12,790 --> 00:16:13,720
You...

333
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,240
The cash cow is back.

334
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:16,380
Make way! Make way!

335
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:17,720
Qingyang!

336
00:16:20,390 --> 00:16:21,360
Eunuch Zhao.

337
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,040
-Eunuch Zhao.
-Eunuch Zhao.

338
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,180
Young Master Qingyang,

339
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:31,710
we need your help urgently.

340
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,000
One at a time.

341
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:37,440
-One at a time. Everyone has a chance.
-Young Master!

342
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,600
We've got the banknotes!

343
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,270
Easy, easy.

344
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:40,270
Don't push! Don't push!

345
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:41,240
Everyone, step back a bit.

346
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:42,190
One at a time!

347
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:44,700
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

348
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,080
Master.

349
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:05,490
[Wind and Moon]

350
00:17:04,349 --> 00:17:05,810
To toast the Crown Prince,

351
00:17:05,829 --> 00:17:07,490
I must do it myself, of course.

352
00:17:08,069 --> 00:17:11,310
You have to play a long game
for a big catch.

353
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,660
I'm looking for the truth,

354
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:15,790
for an answer.

355
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,240
And the one inside

356
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:20,640
may very well be

357
00:17:21,550 --> 00:17:23,079
the answer I'm looking for.

358
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:36,830
Eunuch Zhao,

359
00:17:37,270 --> 00:17:39,240
the Divine Constable Bureau
answers directly to His Majesty.

360
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,480
Not even the imperial family

361
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,890
or nobles

362
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,190
can interfere with our investigations.

363
00:17:44,190 --> 00:17:46,680
Li Si is currently a suspect
caught by the Divine Constable Bureau.

364
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:48,200
If His Highness

365
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,000
shows favoritism and covers up for him,

366
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,960
it will inevitably put His Majesty
in a difficult position.

367
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,020
That won't happen.

368
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,350
If Qingyang

369
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,940
really committed a crime,

370
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,400
as strict and impartial
as His Highness is,

371
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:02,640
he will never cover up for a criminal.

372
00:18:12,270 --> 00:18:15,030
♪ Have you not seen? ♪

373
00:18:16,550 --> 00:18:21,300
♪ Worldly fame is like frost
on the tiles ♪

374
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:28,200
♪ Gold pearls are bitter cold ♪

375
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:32,400
♪ A dream
of traveling thousands of miles ♪

376
00:18:32,430 --> 00:18:38,400
♪ The sun sets before the millet is ripe ♪

377
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:46,240
♪ Purple python robes on Zhuque Street ♪

378
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:52,880
♪ Tonight, the previous dynasty
is buried in the new graves ♪

379
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:57,720
♪ Longquan Sword
severs the net of fame and fortune ♪

380
00:18:57,750 --> 00:19:04,880
♪ Cast the bright moon from my sleeve
into the open sky ♪

381
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,030
Bravo!

382
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,510
Bravo.

383
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:19,110
Your Highness,

384
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:22,240
the song, "Worldly Fame," I just sang

385
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:25,030
conveys the idea that power and wealth

386
00:19:25,070 --> 00:19:26,800
are just like fleeting clouds.

387
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:29,760
Don't fight for them;
don't be obsessed with them.

388
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,310
Hurry, pour the wine.

389
00:19:32,210 --> 00:19:38,470
[Peace of Mind]

390
00:19:33,510 --> 00:19:34,310
Qingyang,

391
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:37,070
you are so serious all of a sudden,

392
00:19:37,070 --> 00:19:38,790
just like those
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

393
00:19:38,790 --> 00:19:40,110
I don't like it.

394
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,240
Let's drink.

395
00:19:50,550 --> 00:19:52,160
Speaking of the Divine Constable Bureau,

396
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:53,110
Your Highness,

397
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:56,350
please help me seek justice.

398
00:19:57,670 --> 00:20:03,210
[Peace of Mind]

399
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,960
Everyone knows that

400
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,200
I'm on your side, Your Highness.

401
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:06,350
I solved the case
of refining the Spice with young girls.

402
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:07,610
The people of Great Shi

403
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:10,350
are all deeply grateful to you,
Your Highness.

404
00:20:11,070 --> 00:20:13,440
Even though I did

405
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,160
make a tiny mistake,

406
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:18,200
my merits could make up for it.

407
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,540
Don't you think so?

408
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:22,350
You are wrong.

409
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,240
Am I?

410
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,970
Of course you are wrong!

411
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,560
I wasn't talking about you.

412
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,030
I mean,

413
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,400
what did you do wrong?

414
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:37,030
Look at me.

415
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:38,790
Those imperial censors

416
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:40,200
always accuse me

417
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,640
of being a spendthrift,

418
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,030
living a life of debauchery,

419
00:20:43,030 --> 00:20:44,290
without holding back.

420
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:45,750
But little do they know that I,
the Crown Prince,

421
00:20:45,750 --> 00:20:48,010
represent the imperial family's honor.

422
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,310
Even if I

423
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:51,110
spend a little

424
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,000
too much

425
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,330
or make a small mistake,

426
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,160
there's no need

427
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,480
to make such a fuss,

428
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,310
right?

429
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:01,640
Your Highness,

430
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,750
you are also wrong.

431
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:05,480
Am I?

432
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,720
Only flowing water

433
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:14,430
is considered living water.

434
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,790
And money

435
00:21:15,790 --> 00:21:17,550
is just like water.

436
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,030
If the future emperor

437
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,040
doesn't know how to spend money,

438
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:23,030
how can he make money?

439
00:21:23,790 --> 00:21:24,640
Therefore,

440
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:26,400
you did nothing wrong.

441
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:35,200
I just love your sweet talk.

442
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:44,480
[Imperial City, Yuque]

443
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:49,830
Your Majesty,

444
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,160
Prince Wenbu of Northern Kun
and his envoys

445
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:53,030
are resting 6 miles

446
00:21:53,030 --> 00:21:54,070
away from Tianhuang City,

447
00:21:54,070 --> 00:21:55,550
waiting for your summons.

448
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:59,270
Just handle it according to the rules.

449
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:00,070
Understood.

450
00:22:08,270 --> 00:22:10,870
Your Majesty,
the Divine Constable Bureau...

451
00:22:11,110 --> 00:22:11,920
Go ahead.

452
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,920
The Divine Constable Bureau asked
the Ministry of Revenue for more funds,

453
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,310
saying that
the original Chunsheng Pavilion

454
00:22:16,310 --> 00:22:17,200
is no longer big enough,

455
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,880
and they need to expand Tianshu Pavilion.

456
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,790
Xiazhang Tower also needs renovation.

457
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:22,830
Next year,
they will also renovate Qiushou Pavilion

458
00:22:22,830 --> 00:22:24,110
and Dongcang Residence.

459
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:26,070
Did the Grand Secretariat say anything?

460
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:27,720
Grand Secretary Bai has already
drafted the approval document,

461
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:31,120
just waiting for your approval
and signature, Your Majesty.

462
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:35,770
[Emperor Shide of the Shi Empire]

463
00:22:35,510 --> 00:22:36,400
Reject it.

464
00:22:39,510 --> 00:22:40,570
Yes, Your Majesty.

465
00:22:44,070 --> 00:22:44,790
Your Majesty,

466
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:47,050
the Chief Censor submitted 2 memorials.

467
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,590
Let her read.

468
00:22:58,790 --> 00:23:01,320
One is from the Ministry of Rites,
saying that

469
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:03,640
the garden recently renovated
by the Crown Prince

470
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:05,240
has 72 door nails,

471
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:07,180
overstepping the limits.

472
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:09,310
The other is
from the Ministry of Personnel,

473
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:11,240
dismissing 13 officials,

474
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:13,780
all of whom work for the First Prince.

475
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:26,640
The Ministry of Personnel is
in the charge of the Crown Prince,

476
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:28,880
while the Ministry of Rites is
overseen by the First Prince.

477
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:30,410
The two sides are fighting.

478
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,460
What's your take on it?

479
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:37,830
The Three Secretariats and Six Ministries
of the Shi Empire

480
00:23:37,830 --> 00:23:39,630
all belong to you, Your Majesty.

481
00:23:44,110 --> 00:23:45,920
Oh, Shan...

482
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:50,240
But right now,

483
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,720
I

484
00:23:52,030 --> 00:23:54,070
do need some "water."

485
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,240
I hope you, Young Master Qingyang,

486
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:57,040
will be willing to lend me a hand.

487
00:23:58,590 --> 00:24:00,200
Your Highness, I wonder which shop

488
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:02,200
you've taken a fancy to again this time.

489
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,920
I will buy the whole street

490
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,000
for you.

491
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:07,140
The Divine Constable Bureau.

492
00:24:14,270 --> 00:24:16,270
Although I am in charge
of the Ministry of Revenue,

493
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:18,880
the funds need documents
drafted by the Grand Secretariat,

494
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:20,590
approved and signed
by my father, His Majesty.

495
00:24:20,590 --> 00:24:22,450
Strange enough, in recent years,

496
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,480
the funds

497
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,270
for the Divine Constable Bureau

498
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,730
have never been approved.

499
00:24:27,110 --> 00:24:28,680
I suppose everyone
in the Divine Constable Bureau

500
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:29,680
must have quite a few complaints

501
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,350
about me, the Crown Prince.

502
00:24:32,270 --> 00:24:33,530
Recently, I heard that

503
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,160
my eldest brother

504
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,030
sent some money

505
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:39,430
to the Divine Constable Bureau in private.

506
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:40,830
He is clearly

507
00:24:40,830 --> 00:24:42,590
going against me.

508
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:45,030
Your Highness,

509
00:24:45,790 --> 00:24:47,920
you and the First Prince are brothers.

510
00:24:48,030 --> 00:24:48,980
Why

511
00:24:49,270 --> 00:24:51,310
do you have to keep fighting like this?

512
00:24:51,310 --> 00:24:52,110
Brothers?

513
00:24:52,530 --> 00:24:53,720
I have no brothers.

514
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:00,030
No brothers.

515
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:04,200
They accepted

516
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,270
my eldest brother's money.

517
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,200
Do you think

518
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:07,590
they'll accept the money

519
00:25:07,590 --> 00:25:08,830
I give them?

520
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,640
I heard that

521
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:16,510
the pair of stone lions at the gate
of the Divine Constable Bureau

522
00:25:16,510 --> 00:25:18,370
haven't been repaired for years.

523
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:25,240
That's why I said

524
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,810
everyone in my Eastern Palace

525
00:25:26,810 --> 00:25:27,660
put together

526
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:29,030
is still nowhere near as smart as you,

527
00:25:29,030 --> 00:25:30,360
Young Master Qingyang.

528
00:25:31,270 --> 00:25:32,070
However,

529
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:34,590
sending banknotes is way too conspicuous.

530
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:36,590
How about I send a person over there?

531
00:25:38,030 --> 00:25:40,240
Instead of sending money
and giving people an excuse to accuse me,

532
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,510
it's better to send you,
the God of Wealth,

533
00:25:41,510 --> 00:25:42,350
over there.

534
00:25:47,920 --> 00:25:48,850
I wouldn't dare.

535
00:25:49,790 --> 00:25:51,640
What kind of place
is the Divine Constable Bureau?

536
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,440
How perilous is it to work there?

537
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,110
Even if

538
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:57,350
one becomes the Chief of it,

539
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,680
it's still

540
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:00,590
not an easy job.

541
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:02,550
Why was the former Chief,

542
00:26:02,790 --> 00:26:04,110
Lu Chong, dismissed?

543
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:05,960
Wasn't it because

544
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:08,030
he was incompetent?

545
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,270
You know nothing.

546
00:26:09,310 --> 00:26:10,240
His Majesty dismissed

547
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:12,370
Lu Chong in order to cover things up...

548
00:26:15,030 --> 00:26:16,490
Anyway, just don't worry.

549
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:17,440
The Divine Constable Bureau is

550
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,680
ranked above all the Secretariats
and Ministries.

551
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:19,240
As long as

552
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:21,370
it doesn't involve imperial affairs,

553
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:23,380
everything will be very safe.

554
00:26:25,200 --> 00:26:26,730
So, Your Highness, you mean

555
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,790
Lu Chong was dismissed

556
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,490
because of imperial affairs?

557
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:33,720
Could it be

558
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:36,200
the incident from 17 years ago...

559
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:36,920
Shut up!

560
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,780
Asking about that, do you want to die?

561
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,110
I've got nothing to do with that incident.

562
00:26:42,110 --> 00:26:43,200
How would I know?

563
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,470
Yes, yes.

564
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,510
If you don't want to talk about it,

565
00:26:48,510 --> 00:26:49,910
I won't bring it up again.

566
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:58,460
This is a toast to you, Your Highness.

567
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,060
Your Highness,

568
00:27:22,070 --> 00:27:25,070
since you want me to join
the Divine Constable Bureau,

569
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:27,350
I am willing to do my best for you.

570
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:29,760
It's just that

571
00:27:30,510 --> 00:27:32,430
I am still under arrest now...

572
00:27:32,430 --> 00:27:33,750
I've got your back.

573
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,520
What's there to be afraid of?

574
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,640
From now on,

575
00:27:38,070 --> 00:27:40,440
you are not only my cash cow,

576
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,680
but also my eyes

577
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:44,000
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

578
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:54,440
Your Highness,

579
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,680
it's almost noon.

580
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:56,590
We need to take Li Si

581
00:27:56,590 --> 00:27:58,650
back to the Divine Constable Bureau.

582
00:28:00,930 --> 00:28:02,290
[Star Room]

583
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,240
Pardon us.

584
00:28:10,030 --> 00:28:11,000
Your Highness,

585
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:13,030
we are ordered to take Li Qingyang back

586
00:28:13,030 --> 00:28:15,760
to the Divine Constable Bureau
for questioning.

587
00:28:17,590 --> 00:28:18,850
Pardon our intrusion.

588
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:30,740
Your Highness,

589
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:32,200
where is Li Si?

590
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,200
How dare you!

591
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,000
Are you

592
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,640
questioning the Crown Prince?

593
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:40,310
Eunuch Zhao.

594
00:28:41,590 --> 00:28:42,720
Are they asking

595
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:44,480
where Li Qingyang is?

596
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:45,590
Yes,

597
00:28:45,810 --> 00:28:46,700
Your Highness.

598
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:49,160
But I

599
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:51,200
have never seen Li Qingyang.

600
00:28:51,510 --> 00:28:52,720
Neither have I.

601
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:54,440
How baffling!

602
00:28:54,930 --> 00:28:57,300
You are wise, Your Highness.

603
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,400
So wise!

604
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:10,990
It's not that I don't have money for you.

605
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,930
I didn't give you funds on purpose.

606
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,720
Do you know why?

607
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:17,440
Waters too clear hold no fish.

608
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,360
I deliberately cut

609
00:29:26,390 --> 00:29:27,880
your Divine Constable Bureau's funding

610
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:29,110
to make you complain about being poor.

611
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:29,920
Look,

612
00:29:31,030 --> 00:29:31,880
hasn't someone

613
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,550
rushed to offer timely help?

614
00:29:34,110 --> 00:29:35,790
Who are they?

615
00:29:36,270 --> 00:29:37,400
The First Prince is one.

616
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:39,680
I think the Crown Prince is also restless.

617
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:41,200
One sent money.

618
00:29:42,270 --> 00:29:43,470
What about the other?

619
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:44,610
What did he send?

620
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:50,270
The Crown Prince wanted to send someone

621
00:29:50,270 --> 00:29:52,200
into the Divine Constable Bureau.

622
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:53,200
Who?

623
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:56,960
Young Master Qingyang, Li Si.

624
00:29:58,440 --> 00:30:01,100
This person is pretty talented
at making money.

625
00:30:01,270 --> 00:30:02,510
In 3 years since he entered the business,

626
00:30:02,510 --> 00:30:03,480
he has opened branches

627
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:05,510
of his Star-Gathering Pavilion
all over Great Shi.

628
00:30:05,510 --> 00:30:06,440
Rumor has it that

629
00:30:06,510 --> 00:30:08,000
this person is a suave gentleman

630
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:09,440
who spends money like water,

631
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:11,070
hits it off with the Crown Prince,

632
00:30:11,070 --> 00:30:12,440
and is very close to His Highness.

633
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,720
His age and birthplace

634
00:30:13,830 --> 00:30:15,110
remain unknown.

635
00:30:15,590 --> 00:30:17,650
It was only in the 20th year of Hongyun

636
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:19,640
that the record

637
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:22,140
of his household registration
appeared at the border.

638
00:30:22,140 --> 00:30:24,680
[Guo Anbang, Head Eunuch]

639
00:30:29,510 --> 00:30:31,070
The 20th year of Hongyun?

640
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:33,720
Continue.

641
00:30:34,790 --> 00:30:35,590
Moreover,

642
00:30:36,030 --> 00:30:38,630
he once broke into Tianshu Pavilion
in secret.

643
00:30:39,030 --> 00:30:40,480
He was also a suspect
in the case of refining the Spice

644
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:41,480
with young girls.

645
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:42,960
A suspect?

646
00:30:44,030 --> 00:30:45,290
You didn't arrest him?

647
00:30:45,510 --> 00:30:47,040
It was a misunderstanding.

648
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,880
Later, Young Master Qingyang,
as a commoner,

649
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:51,140
helped our bureau find the real culprit.

650
00:30:53,070 --> 00:30:54,750
Do as you see fit.

651
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,440
Yes,

652
00:30:57,070 --> 00:30:58,160
Your Majesty.

653
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:00,790
Shan.

654
00:31:03,310 --> 00:31:04,370
Yes, Your Majesty.

655
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,500
Since your elder sister passed away,

656
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:13,160
among my peers,

657
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:15,070
apart from Grand Secretary Bai,

658
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,790
you're the only one

659
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:18,960
I can truly talk to.

660
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:22,920
From now on,
when there are just the two of us,

661
00:31:22,920 --> 00:31:24,520
feel free to speak your mind.

662
00:31:24,830 --> 00:31:26,690
Don't be so distant with me, okay?

663
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,110
Understood.

664
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,440
The 20th year of Hongyun...

665
00:31:56,120 --> 00:32:01,280
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

666
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:07,000
Sir,

667
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:09,270
standing before the Shangfang Drum,

668
00:32:09,270 --> 00:32:11,750
do you have any grievance to air?

669
00:32:17,590 --> 00:32:18,400
Legend has it

670
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:20,070
that in the Shi Empire,

671
00:32:20,050 --> 00:32:21,700
[Shangfang Drum]

672
00:32:20,070 --> 00:32:21,310
from imperial family

673
00:32:21,510 --> 00:32:22,680
to commoners,

674
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:27,150
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

675
00:32:23,070 --> 00:32:24,930
no matter what grievance one has,

676
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:27,440
as long as they beat this Shangfang Drum,

677
00:32:27,440 --> 00:32:28,790
the Divine Constable Bureau

678
00:32:28,790 --> 00:32:31,550
will solve their problems

679
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:33,340
and seek justice for them.

680
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:37,040
Three beats of the drum,
and your plea will reach His Majesty.

681
00:32:37,240 --> 00:32:38,070
May I ask

682
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:39,880
who you are, lady?

683
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:43,800
And what's your relationship
with the Divine Constable Bureau?

684
00:32:45,830 --> 00:32:47,720
What brings you

685
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:50,120
to the Divine Constable Bureau, young man?

686
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,270
I'd like

687
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:58,460
to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

688
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:06,030
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

689
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,090
-Chief.
-Chief.

690
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:12,680
Li Qingyang,

691
00:33:12,830 --> 00:33:15,000
you recognized me long ago,

692
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:17,920
yet you called me lady.

693
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:19,310
How shameless.

694
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:21,920
So,

695
00:33:22,590 --> 00:33:23,680
Chief,

696
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:25,760
you also knew my identity long ago.

697
00:33:29,010 --> 00:33:31,350
[Divine Constable Bureau]

698
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,640
I am Li Si, a commoner.

699
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:33,680
Greetings,
Chief of the Divine Constable Bureau,

700
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:34,920
Lady Xuanyuan.

701
00:33:37,070 --> 00:33:38,440
You are a prisoner.

702
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:40,400
Where are your shackles?

703
00:33:56,950 --> 00:33:58,080
[Law Prevails]

704
00:33:58,310 --> 00:33:59,440
Chief,

705
00:33:59,510 --> 00:34:00,960
I have long heard that
the Divine Constable Bureau

706
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,200
safeguards the peace and security

707
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,510
of Great Shi

708
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:04,960
as the pillar of the state.

709
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:05,880
Thanks to

710
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:07,830
the instructions of Constable Ghost

711
00:34:07,830 --> 00:34:08,960
and Constable Frost

712
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,440
along the way,

713
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:13,630
I admire
the Divine Constable Bureau deeply.

714
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,710
I wish to join the Divine Constable Bureau

715
00:34:15,710 --> 00:34:16,880
to serve the state.

716
00:34:17,150 --> 00:34:19,800
I hope you will grant my wish, Chief.

717
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:23,920
Since the establishment
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

718
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:26,550
the selection criteria
have been extremely harsh.

719
00:34:26,550 --> 00:34:28,280
Not only must they be absolutely loyal,

720
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,800
with both brains and brawn,

721
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,190
but more importantly,

722
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:33,360
they must have clean backgrounds.

723
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:34,670
This condition alone

724
00:34:34,670 --> 00:34:37,530
can leave you unqualified,
Young Master Qingyang.

725
00:34:37,960 --> 00:34:39,190
What makes you think

726
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:41,730
you can join the Divine Constable Bureau?

727
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:50,190
Back in Dougu County,

728
00:34:50,710 --> 00:34:52,150
I joined hands with the two constables

729
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:54,000
to solve the Moluo Flower Case,

730
00:34:54,190 --> 00:34:55,510
which could be considered

731
00:34:55,510 --> 00:34:57,280
protecting the local people.

732
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:58,150
This is

733
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:02,000
somewhat a merit
I've earned for myself, right?

734
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,440
As a commoner, you

735
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:07,150
interfered in the case
managed by our Divine Constable Bureau

736
00:35:07,150 --> 00:35:09,510
and secretly broke into Tianshu Pavilion.

737
00:35:09,510 --> 00:35:11,150
Were it not for your little merit

738
00:35:11,150 --> 00:35:12,590
of helping solve the case,

739
00:35:12,590 --> 00:35:14,800
you would be in prison right now.

740
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:18,120
With your merit offsetting your fault,

741
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:20,000
let's consider the score

742
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,320
settled.

743
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:31,760
You may get up.

744
00:35:35,110 --> 00:35:36,320
Thank you, Chief.

745
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:43,080
Since your merit has offset your fault,

746
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:46,520
on what grounds
can you join the Divine Constable Bureau?

747
00:35:55,590 --> 00:35:57,590
I am the Crown Prince's good friend.

748
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:58,920
As far as I know,

749
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:00,710
Chief,

750
00:36:00,710 --> 00:36:03,150
you are the younger sister
of the late Empress,

751
00:36:03,150 --> 00:36:05,960
which makes you the Crown Prince's aunt.

752
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:08,590
Considering this relationship...

753
00:36:08,590 --> 00:36:10,920
The Divine Constable Bureau is independent
of the imperial court,

754
00:36:10,920 --> 00:36:12,920
never influenced by personal ties.

755
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:17,760
You are just a friend of the Crown Prince.

756
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,710
Even the Crown Prince himself

757
00:36:19,710 --> 00:36:21,400
would have to pass our assessment

758
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:23,460
to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

759
00:36:23,490 --> 00:36:24,520
I believe

760
00:36:25,150 --> 00:36:26,550
there's no door in the world

761
00:36:26,550 --> 00:36:28,010
that can't be pushed open.

762
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:29,480
It just depends on whether you're willing

763
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,670
and brave enough to push.

764
00:36:30,670 --> 00:36:32,230
Whatever the trial,

765
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:34,440
I am willing to take it on.

766
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:39,670
Actually,

767
00:36:40,070 --> 00:36:42,070
a year's salary
at the Divine Constable Bureau

768
00:36:42,070 --> 00:36:43,230
can't even cover your expenses

769
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:45,290
in one night, Young Master Qingyang.

770
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:47,440
Why do you want to join

771
00:36:49,070 --> 00:36:50,730
the Divine Constable Bureau?

772
00:37:01,710 --> 00:37:02,910
To be honest with you,

773
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,280
besides

774
00:37:04,510 --> 00:37:05,710
making money

775
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:07,110
and doing business,

776
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:10,000
my biggest hobby is

777
00:37:12,670 --> 00:37:13,930
investigating cases.

778
00:37:15,320 --> 00:37:17,230
If I hear of an unsolved case,

779
00:37:17,230 --> 00:37:18,000
I just

780
00:37:19,490 --> 00:37:21,590
can't sleep well or eat well

781
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:23,440
before I find the real culprit.

782
00:37:24,020 --> 00:37:24,830
Therefore,

783
00:37:25,150 --> 00:37:27,070
if I can join the Divine Constable Bureau,

784
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,960
which symbolizes the authority of the law,

785
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,320
be a constable,

786
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:31,960
solve cases, and catch culprits,

787
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:35,070
then I would have no regrets in this life.

788
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,880
Constable Ghost, Constable Frost,

789
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:43,880
what do you think?

790
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:45,280
Chief,

791
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:47,190
Li Qingyang

792
00:37:47,190 --> 00:37:49,070
is indeed capable.

793
00:37:49,590 --> 00:37:50,880
But I think

794
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:53,070
he is used to being
an undisciplined, free spirit.

795
00:37:53,070 --> 00:37:53,920
I'm afraid he can't stand

796
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:56,980
the Divine Constable Bureau's rules
and regulations.

797
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:57,960
When solving cases,

798
00:37:57,960 --> 00:37:59,690
he has his own unique insights.

799
00:38:00,070 --> 00:38:01,880
But to join the Divine Constable Bureau,

800
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,410
an assessment is required.

801
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:05,690
Do you hear that?

802
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,320
They want to test you.

803
00:38:07,710 --> 00:38:09,000
I agree.

804
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:12,410
Whoever wants to test him,
set the questions.

805
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:15,960
Please bring it on, My Lord, My Lady.

806
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:17,590
Li Qingyang,

807
00:38:18,190 --> 00:38:20,280
the Northern Kun delegation
is about to enter the capital.

808
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:21,550
We cannot let the scoundrels

809
00:38:21,550 --> 00:38:22,510
in Tianhuang City

810
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:24,280
ruin the imperial court's dignity.

811
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:26,880
The Divine Constable Bureau has imposed
martial law across the city lately.

812
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,960
You can make your contribution.

813
00:38:31,670 --> 00:38:33,320
Lady Constable Frost, do you

814
00:38:34,150 --> 00:38:35,960
want me to catch a few criminals?

815
00:38:36,320 --> 00:38:37,320
Don't send over

816
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,550
any petty criminals.

817
00:38:38,550 --> 00:38:41,610
It'll be beneath your status
as Young Master Qingyang.

818
00:38:43,150 --> 00:38:45,550
Then please enlighten me.
What kind of criminal

819
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:47,320
is not considered a petty one?

820
00:38:48,150 --> 00:38:52,010
Young Master Qingyang, have you
ever heard of the Underworld Market?

821
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:54,960
Constable Ghost,

822
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:57,480
tell Li Si about the Underworld Market.

823
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,630
Yes, Chief.

824
00:39:00,590 --> 00:39:02,480
The Underworld Market
in the suburbs of Tianhuang City

825
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:03,550
is the largest black market,

826
00:39:03,550 --> 00:39:05,280
also known as the Ghost Market.

827
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:07,320
The vendors inside act outside the law,

828
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,800
selling banned drugs

829
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:10,000
and rare items.

830
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:11,590
The Divine Constable Bureau
intends to purge them,

831
00:39:11,590 --> 00:39:13,550
but those vendors are elusive

832
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:14,920
and extremely cunning.

833
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:17,450
I have searched for years,
yet found no clues.

834
00:39:17,550 --> 00:39:19,030
Lord Constable Ghost
has searched for years

835
00:39:19,030 --> 00:39:20,560
without finding any clues.

836
00:39:21,070 --> 00:39:22,150
And, Chief,

837
00:39:23,190 --> 00:39:24,720
you want me to investigate?

838
00:39:26,550 --> 00:39:28,280
This is such a hard nut to crack.

839
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:30,550
Chief, I think you just

840
00:39:31,550 --> 00:39:33,880
don't want me
to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

841
00:39:33,880 --> 00:39:35,800
I didn't ask you to catch them all.

842
00:39:36,550 --> 00:39:37,800
Catching a contact

843
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:39,960
or finding some contraband goods
from the Ghost Market

844
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:41,420
will be considered a pass.

845
00:39:46,630 --> 00:39:47,360
Young Landlord,

846
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:48,880
is it really just a fine?

847
00:39:48,880 --> 00:39:49,920
No going to jail?

848
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:50,510
It's not easy to fool

849
00:39:50,510 --> 00:39:52,170
the Divine Constable Bureau.

850
00:39:52,710 --> 00:39:54,170
This is way too difficult.

851
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,920
Lord Constable Ghost
has searched for years

852
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,450
and hasn't found anything.

853
00:39:58,670 --> 00:39:59,510
I think...

854
00:40:01,280 --> 00:40:03,150
I'll probably fail this time.

855
00:40:03,230 --> 00:40:04,630
Yes, they're not easy to fool.

856
00:40:04,630 --> 00:40:05,440
However...

857
00:40:08,030 --> 00:40:09,030
I will still

858
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,400
try my best

859
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:13,150
to live up to your expectations.

860
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:14,760
The things you sell

861
00:40:15,150 --> 00:40:16,150
can't kill

862
00:40:16,150 --> 00:40:17,110
or harm anyone.

863
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,540
I'll take my leave.

864
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,230
Don't worry!

865
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,510
When you're caught,

866
00:40:21,510 --> 00:40:22,710
I will cover

867
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:24,150
all the fines.

868
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:27,440
Anyone willing

869
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,870
to play along with me

870
00:40:29,110 --> 00:40:31,510
will have one year's rent waived.

871
00:40:31,510 --> 00:40:32,400
I'm willing to do it!

872
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:33,360
-I'll do it!
-I'll go!

873
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:34,800
Ten people at most.

874
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:36,590
Too many would look fake.

875
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:40,380
[Divine Constable Bureau]

876
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:40,680
How splendid!

877
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,710
Oh my goodness, look at this.

878
00:40:42,710 --> 00:40:43,710
Is it made of gold?

879
00:40:43,710 --> 00:40:45,150
I really wish I could touch it.

880
00:40:45,150 --> 00:40:47,810
It's so grand.
I've never seen anything like it.

881
00:40:48,320 --> 00:40:49,150
Silence!

882
00:40:52,150 --> 00:40:53,710
You! What are you doing?

883
00:40:54,110 --> 00:40:55,150
Don't make any noise.

884
00:40:55,150 --> 00:40:56,680
Everyone, kneel properly.

885
00:41:00,550 --> 00:41:01,710
You, kneel down.

886
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:03,590
I'm already on my knees.

887
00:41:05,590 --> 00:41:06,710
You're still this tall on your knees?

888
00:41:06,710 --> 00:41:07,630
You should see me

889
00:41:07,630 --> 00:41:08,920
when I'm standing.

890
00:41:09,150 --> 00:41:10,190
Then stand up.

891
00:41:18,550 --> 00:41:19,710
Kneel down!

892
00:41:19,880 --> 00:41:20,670
Kneel!

893
00:41:22,150 --> 00:41:22,960
It's me.

894
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:25,080
Stop blabbering. Kneel properly.

895
00:41:25,670 --> 00:41:26,600
Kneel properly.

896
00:41:29,510 --> 00:41:30,590
Behave yourselves

897
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:32,420
and listen to the constables.

898
00:41:33,150 --> 00:41:34,320
Come clean!

899
00:41:34,710 --> 00:41:35,800
Everyone must sign a guarantee

900
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:36,730
before leaving!

901
00:41:39,710 --> 00:41:40,590
Chief,

902
00:41:41,110 --> 00:41:43,110
although these culprits
have violated the law,

903
00:41:43,110 --> 00:41:44,840
their offenses are very minor.

904
00:41:45,550 --> 00:41:47,150
Let's detain them for 3 days,

905
00:41:47,670 --> 00:41:49,070
have them
pay a ransom of 20 taels of silver

906
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:50,030
as a guarantee,

907
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:53,360
and then release them, pending summons.
How's that?

908
00:41:53,360 --> 00:41:55,110
Just detain... Just detain us for 3 days.

909
00:41:55,110 --> 00:41:56,150
I heard that.

910
00:41:56,150 --> 00:41:56,510
Silence!

911
00:41:56,510 --> 00:41:57,710
I heard it.

912
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:03,710
Yes, Chief.

913
00:42:04,550 --> 00:42:05,360
Go.

914
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:06,550
Go!

915
00:42:06,550 --> 00:42:07,280
Go!

916
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:09,000
-Go!
-Be gentle! I can walk myself!

917
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:09,840
Three days?

918
00:42:10,070 --> 00:42:10,880
Three days.

919
00:42:12,030 --> 00:42:12,840
Go.

920
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,510
Chief.

921
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:23,550
I wonder

922
00:42:24,320 --> 00:42:25,710
if I caught enough

923
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:26,960
of them.

924
00:42:27,710 --> 00:42:29,280
If you're not satisfied,

925
00:42:29,710 --> 00:42:31,040
I can go catch some more.

926
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,710
I deliberately cut

927
00:42:37,710 --> 00:42:39,510
your Divine Constable Bureau's funding

928
00:42:39,510 --> 00:42:41,640
to make you complain about being poor.

929
00:42:41,880 --> 00:42:42,670
Look,

930
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:44,960
hasn't someone rushed

931
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,320
to offer timely help?

932
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:48,400
I also want to see

933
00:42:49,070 --> 00:42:50,710
who in the imperial court

934
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:53,540
wants to win over
your Divine Constable Bureau.

935
00:42:53,550 --> 00:42:55,920
If the Divine Constable Bureau
wants to grasp and see into

936
00:42:55,920 --> 00:42:58,150
the trends of various forces
in the imperial court,

937
00:42:58,150 --> 00:42:58,960
we must open a door

938
00:42:58,960 --> 00:43:00,360
exceptionally for those

939
00:43:00,360 --> 00:43:02,280
with ulterior motives.

940
00:43:04,920 --> 00:43:06,960
Since you want to join
the Divine Constable Bureau,

941
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:08,150
let me see

942
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:10,620
what kind of person you are, Li Qingyang.

943
00:43:19,800 --> 00:43:21,550
I hereby admit Li Si

944
00:43:21,710 --> 00:43:23,710
into the Divine Constable Bureau

945
00:43:23,760 --> 00:43:25,480
as a Trainee Constable.

946
00:43:25,590 --> 00:43:26,630
Chief!

947
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:28,490
No further discussion on this.

948
00:43:28,960 --> 00:43:29,960
Constable Eagle,

949
00:43:31,070 --> 00:43:32,150
take Constable Li

950
00:43:32,150 --> 00:43:33,880
to get familiar with the environment.

951
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:36,110
Tell him all the rules and regulations

952
00:43:36,110 --> 00:43:37,800
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

953
00:43:37,800 --> 00:43:38,590
Yes, Chief.

954
00:43:43,320 --> 00:43:45,550
Since you've joined
our Divine Constable Bureau,

955
00:43:45,550 --> 00:43:47,590
you must uphold justice
and abide by the law.

956
00:43:47,590 --> 00:43:49,000
If you break the rules,

957
00:43:49,320 --> 00:43:51,520
there are regulations for punishment.

958
00:43:52,480 --> 00:43:53,280
Understood.

959
00:43:54,150 --> 00:43:55,230
I'll follow your instructions, Chief.
